  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Full release notes: https://github.com/rafalka/MauiSkiaUi/blob/v1.1.0/CHANGELOG.md#110\n\nBreaking changes\n- Mac Catalyst 17.0 minimum: SkiaUi.Maui and SkiaUi.Maui.CommunityToolkit target Mac Catalyst 17.0 (macOS 14) or newer, up from 15.0, because the Mac Catalyst workload that builds with Xcode 27 refuses lower minimums. Apps set SupportedOSPlatformVersion for maccatalyst to 17.0 or higher. iOS stays at 15.0.\n- Xcode 27 builds need the UIKit scene lifecycle: iOS 27 closes apps built with Xcode 27 that don't use it. Each app adds a SceneDelegate : MauiUISceneDelegate on iOS and Mac Catalyst and a UIApplicationSceneManifest in each Info.plist that names it. The library itself needs no change.",
